menu "CAT Bridge BLE"

    config BRIDGE_BLE_REQUIRE_BONDING
        bool "Require LE encryption + bonding for CAT/CTRL access"
        default y
        help
            Release policy (docs/implementation.md §4): this link can key a
            100 W transmitter, so an open bridge is a safety problem. When
            enabled, writes to CAT_RX/CTRL are rejected until the link is
            encrypted (Just Works bonding, LE Secure Connections).

            Disable ONLY for debug/bring-up builds. The LED signals the
            insecure state with a triple-blink burst (§5.6).

endmenu
